\f1\b \cf0 Risk points:
\f0\b0 \strokec2  The core risk isn't that you'll become manipulative or unkind \'97 your empathy and ethics scores argue strongly against that. The core risk is a 
\f2\i \strokec2 communication and trust gap
\f0\i0 \strokec2 : people around you may sense strategic caution ("what aren't they telling me?") even when your intentions are good, and your humility may mean you don't correct that impression by being more visible about your reasoning.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \
