\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Week 1 \'97 Transparency & Intent-Checking\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Micro-experiment:
\f0\b0 \strokec2  Once a day, before you decide how much to share about your reasoning on a decision, ask "What would I want to know if I were on the other side of this?" \'97 then share at least that much, even if it costs you a little tactical advantage.\

\f1\b \strokec2 Workplace behavior:
\f0\b0 \strokec2  In one meeting this week, explicitly narrate your reasoning ("Here's why I'm recommending this, and here's the tradeoff I'm weighing") rather than just delivering the conclusion.\

\f1\b \strokec2 Reflection questions (end of week):
